1
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:20,980
After I had had lunch at a village pub, I looked for my bag.

2
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:27,450
I had left it on a chair beside the door and now it wasn't there!

3
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:32,450
As I was looking for it, the landlord came in.

4
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:35,000
'Did you have a good meal?"

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:35,940
he asked.

6
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:41,934
'Yes, thank you,' I answered, 'but I can't pay the bill.

7
00:00:41,934 --> 00:00:44,300
I haven't got my bag.'

8
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:48,800
The landlord smiled and immediately went out.

9
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:54,930
In a few minutes he returned with my bag and gave it back to me.

10
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,430
'I'm very sorry,' he said.

11
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:03,484
'My dog had taken in into the garden.

12
00:01:03,484 --> 00:01:06,192
He often does this!'
